      "content": "the metaphors aren't really helping me debug here. can we stick to the technical side? specifically, besides formatting issues, are there any specific fields in the JSON payload that typically trigger a 402 if they are null or malformed? and how can i log the exact raw request being sent to the gateway so i can compare it to the documentation?",
